OL,3,ARoyal Family pays respects in Aberfan,
OL,4,A60 years after coal tip disaster killed
OL,5,A116 children and 28 adults
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople in Aberfan, south Wales, are
OL,8,Fremembering the disaster 60 years ago
OL,9,Fwhen a coal waste tip collapsed on a
OL,10,Fschool and homes
OL,12,FOn 21 October 1966, 116 children and 28
OL,13,Fadults were killed when the colliery
OL,14,Fspoil tip collapsed and engulfed
OL,15,FPantglas Junior School and surrounding
OL,16,Fhouses
OL,18,FEmergency services, miners and people
OL,19,Fwho rushed to the village began an
OL,20,Faround-the-clock battle to dig out
OL,21,Fthose trapped by the debris
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
