OL,3,ARoyal Family pays respects in Aberfan,
OL,4,A60 years after coal tip disaster killed
OL,5,A116 children and 28 adults
OL,6,
OL,7,FMair Morgan, the last surviving teacher
OL,8,Fat the school, still remembers having
OL,9,Fto identify the children who died
OL,11,FKing Charles, Queen Camilla and the
OL,12,FPrince of Wales have laid wreaths at a
OL,13,Fmemorial garden that stands on the site
OL,14,Fof the school, and they are now joining
OL,15,Fsurvivors, bereaved parents and other
OL,16,Fmembers of the community
OL,18,FA prayer and moment of silence was held
OL,19,Fat 09:15 to mark the moment the coal
OL,20,Fspoil struck the village
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
